tianrover_navigation/config/nav2.yaml derives from Navigation2's Humble nav2_bringup/params/nav2_params.yaml.
Navigation2 is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/ros-navigation/navigation2/tree/humble
License: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
Modifications: MarsRover frame choices, conservative acceleration, footprint/inflation
defaults; runtime environment overrides and namespace resolution are implemented
separately in tianrover_common/tianrover_common/config.py and
tianrover_navigation/tianrover_navigation/launching.py.

tianrover_description/urdf/mars.urdf is the model deployed on the user's NX at 192.168.1.42,
retrieved 2026-10-07 and corrected as documented in docs/guides/MODEL.md.
The 21 referenced meshes were copied unchanged from the vehicle's original
tianbot_description on 2026-10-14 and are now shipped in tianrover_description.
Their SHA-256 values were compared with the vehicle and recorded in
tianrover_description/meshes.sha256. The original vehicle resources were not modified.

tianrover_slam/config/cartographer.lua derives from the existing Tianbot Cartographer configuration,
which preserves The Cartographer Authors' Apache-2.0 header. Cartographer ROS is
installed as the ROS 2 Humble distribution package.

Gmapping is a separately imported upstream source dependency, pinned by
dependencies/dependencies-2d.repos to Adlink-ROS/slam_gmapping 0559987de50371356b4caeca93e5ba59efee7543.
Its slam_gmapping and openslam_gmapping package.xml files declare
CreativeCommons-by-nc-sa-2.0. This integration does not relicense those dependencies
as TianRover BSD-3-Clause or make a commercial-use license claim.
Upstream: https://github.com/Adlink-ROS/slam_gmapping

pointcloud_to_laserscan is imported from its official Humble branch at
59bf996fb3ee7db0026a5cd3ce0d2a39d2e602ea (BSD). The local patch adds an optional
reliable_cloud input QoS parameter; upstream default remains false.

The tianrover_gazebo Mini model, terrain and C++ plugins were migrated from
/home/tianbot/tianbot_ws/src/tianrover_gazebo on 2026-10-15. Mesh files are
copied unchanged. The original C++ copyright and license notices are retained.
ROS 2 modifications replace catkin/roscpp/tf, migrate launch and joint-state
configuration, bound path history, correct odometry twist frames and add a
command watchdog. The original ROS 1 checkout is not modified.
